  "title": "Authentic Thousand Island Dressing",
  "description": "This flavorful Thousand Island dressing is peppered with bits of hard-boiled egg, sweet pickle, olives, red bell peppers, and a sprinkling of ground cloves.",
  "authors": [
    "A Local 1000 Islander"
  ],
